  "rarity": "Rare",
  "rawText": "Item Class: Maps\nRarity: Rare\nSteel Voyage\nMap (Tier 16)\n--------\nAtlas Drops: +52% (augmented)\nItem Rarity: +31% (augmented)\nMonster Pack Size: +20% (augmented)\n--------\nItem Level: 83\n--------\nMonster Level: 83\n--------\n{ Implicit Modifier }\nArea is influenced by The Elder — Unscalable Value\nMap is occupied by The Constrictor(...) — Unscalable Value\n{ Implicit Modifier }\nArea is Influenced by the Originator's Memories — Unscalable Value\n--------\n{ Prefix Modifier \"Fecund\" — Life }\n44(40-49)% more Monster Life\n{ Prefix Modifier \"Conflagrating\" — Elemental, Fire, Ailment }\nAll Monster Damage from Hits always Ignites — Unscalable Value\n(Ignite deals Fire Damage over time, based on the base Fire Damage of the Skill, for 4 seconds)\n{ Suffix Modifier \"of Vulnerability\" — Caster, Curse }\nPlayers are Cursed with Vulnerability\n(Vulnerability is a Hex which increases Physical Damage taken by 15% and causes Hits to have +25% chance to inflict Bleeding on the target. It lasts 8 seconds)\n{ Suffix Modifier \"of Venom\" — Chaos, Ailment }\nMonsters Poison on Hit — Unscalable Value\n(Poison deals Chaos Damage over time, based on the base Physical and Chaos Damage of the Skill. Multiple instances of Poison stack)\n--------\nTravel to a Map of this tier or lower by using this in a personal Map Device. Maps can only be used once. \n",
